      "text": "[9:13PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth movement from Gbagada Bridge, Olopomeji, and Ifako to Ogudu, NNPC Filling Station, and down to Alapere.\nGood traffic flow from Alapere to Ojota Bridge, connecting Tollgate, and down to Secretariat, all the way to Otedola and inward towards Berger.\nEfficient return journey from Otedola to Tollgate, and down to Alapere, all the way to Carwash and inward towards Island.\n\nAt present, there are no reported impediments, and traffic is moving well in both directions.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
