      "text": "[9:57PM] #Iju_Ishaga #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth movement from Agege Pen Cinema inward to Jungle Junction.\nGood traffic flow from Jungle Junction inward to Fagba Intersection.\nSlow movement from Fagba Intersection inward to Jonathan Coker due to road damage at the railway crossing.\nGood movement on Johnathan Coker College Road inward to Yaya Abatan Road, and down to Ajayi Junction, towards Excellence Hotel.\n\nNo impediments have been reported, and officers are actively on ground to monitor and manage the traffic situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
